ze Your Career Digest Receive jobs, internships, events, and resources tailored to your interests. Picture of Parrish Hall from the Magill Walk steps. Upcoming Events September Sep 08 Event: USPS - Automotive Technician Zoom Webinar - Memphis, TN Tue, Sep 8 from 10am - 11am Tuesday, September 8th from 10am - 11am Sep 08 Event: Meet the Business - Wealth, U.S. Consumer Cards & Services (North America Session) Tue, Sep 8 from 5pm - 5:45pm Tuesday, September 8th from 5pm - 5:45pm Sep 08 Event: TFA Philly Back to School Mixer Tue, Sep 8 from 5pm - 7pm Tuesday, September 8th from 5pm - 7pm Sep 08 Event: Unlock Your Future: Banking Analyst Internships in Japan (North America) Tue, Sep 8 from 7pm - 8pm Tuesday, September 8th from 7pm - 8pm Sep 09 Event: Financing your Legal Education Wed, Sep 9 from 12pm - 1pm Wednesday, September 9th from 12pm - 1pm Sep 09 Event: Epic Careers Tech Talk: Improving Access – Adolescent Medicine Wed, Sep 9 from 1pm - 2pm Wednesday, September 9th from 1pm - 2pm Sep 09 Event: TD Securities Information Session: 2027 Global Transaction Banking Summer Program Wed, Sep 9 from 5:30pm - 6pm Wednesday, September 9th from 5:30pm - 6pm Sep 09 Event: 2026 Morgan Stanley Firmwide Presentation - Wednesday, September 9th Wed, Sep 9 from 5:30pm - 6:30pm Wednesday, September 9th from 5:30pm - 6:30pm Sep 09 Event: Analysis Group EngAGement Series: Analyst Panel Discussion - Swarthmore College Wed, Sep 9 from 6pm - 6:45pm Wednesday, September 9th from 6pm - 6:45pm Sep 09 Event: Career Fellows Lab: Handshake 101 Wed, Sep 9 from 7pm - 8pm Wednesday, September 9th from 7pm - 8pm See more events News & Advice September 2026 Events Share This: Share September 2026 Events on Facebook Share September 2026 Events on LinkedIn Share September 2026 Events on X Copy Link The following events are hosted by Career Services, a Tri-Co college, or an employer or institutional partner. See the events page of our website for a full list of events, and follow @swatcareers on Instagram for additional news and updates. By Talia Barnes Show author info Talia Barnes Send Email Read more » Career Advising for First Years Share This: Share Career Advising for First Years on Facebook Share Career Advising for First Years on LinkedIn Share Career Advising for First Years on X Copy Link Incoming students: Welcome to Swarthmore! We’re excited to meet you. As you adjust to college life and explore new possibilities, we encourage you to meet with a Career Advisor. By Talia Barnes Show author info Talia Barnes Send Email Read more » Dear Graduates: Leveraging Your Liberal Arts Education Share This: Share Dear Graduates: Leveraging Your Liberal Arts Education on Facebook Share Dear Graduates: Leveraging Your Liberal Arts Education on LinkedIn Share Dear Graduates: Leveraging Your Liberal Arts Education on X Copy Link Congratulations, Class of 2026! We hope you are proud of all your accomplishments during your time at Swarthmore College. While some of you know what your next steps will be, we know others may be working to figure out their  … By Kelly Dougherty Show author info Kelly Dougherty Associate Director, Employer Connections Send Email Read more » View All Blogs Sidebar Customize Your Career Content Here! Job & Internship Opportunities Associate, Construction Delay Consulting Secretariat Analyst Kennedy & Company Education Strategies, LLC Videography Editor Egéa Wealth Management, Field Subject Matter Expert – Outside Plant Fiber Telecommunications StarTech Networks Inc. (Formerly GTL USA Inc.) Construction Manager (Fiber Telecommunications) StarTech Networks Inc. (Formerly GTL USA Inc.) EY-Parthenon full-time roles EY-Parthenon Student Videographer & Social Content Producer Elias Real Estate Group Marketing Coordinator SunCoast Property Management, LLC Entry Level Marketing Associate Conatus Marketing, Inc. Marketing and Development Assistant Contemporary American Theater Festival See All Jobs Contact & Location Phone (610) 328–8352 Email career@swarthmore.edu Address 500 College Ave. Parrish Hall 135 Swarthmore, PA 19081 Career Service Hours M Monday 8:30 am – 4:30 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am – 4:30 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am – 4:30 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am – 4:30 pm F Friday 8:30 am – 4:30 pm Office closed daily from 12–1pm for lunch. Meet the Team Claire Klieger Meet Claire Klieger Erin Massey Meet Erin Massey Kristie Beucler Meet Kristie Beucler Jennifer Barrington Meet Jennifer Barrington Pattie Kim-Keefer Meet Pattie Kim-Keefer Kelly Dougherty Meet Kelly Dougherty Talia Barnes Meet Talia Barnes Carina Shandy Meet Carina Shandy Phone (610) 328–8352 Email career@swarthmore.edu Address 500 College Ave. Parrish Hall 135 Swarthmore, PA 19081 Facebook Twitter Instagram LinkedIn YouTube TikTok If you have encountered an issue with the site, including concerns about accessibility due to a disability, please share your feedback with us . Privacy Policy › Accessibility Policy › Non-Discrimination and Equal Opportunity Policy › Footer Column 1 A-Z Index Arts @ Swarthmore Calendar Campus & Community Store Campus Map Career Services Chester Children’s Chorus Footer Column 2 Directory Lang Center for Civic & Social Responsibility Make a Gift Offices & Services Scott Arboretum Visit Swarthmore Work at Swarthmore Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Swarthmore College"
